t's Max Mana and burns part of it away. Deals additional damage equal to a percentage of the damage the target has taken from Nyx Assassin in the last %damage_echo_duration%s. Resets accumulated damage before applying damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_mana_as_damage_pct", "mana_burn_pct", "aoe", "damage_echo_duration", "damage_echo_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_spiked_carapace", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·尖刺外壳", "name_en": "Spiked Carapace", "description_zh": "激活状态下，尖刺外壳可以反弹并无效化司夜刺客受到的伤害（每个攻击者最多作用一次），同时眩晕攻击者。激活尖刺外壳不会打破复仇的隐身状态。\n\n钻地状态下尖刺外壳施放后将立刻眩晕周围的敌人。", "description_en": "When activated while above ground, Spiked Carapace reflects and negates damage dealt to Nyx Assassin (max once from each source), as well as stunning the source of the damage. Activating Spiked Carapace will not break Vendetta invisibility.\n\nWhile Burrowed, Spiked Carapace instantly stuns nearby enemies when cast.", "notes_zh": ["反弹的伤害与司夜刺客本应受到的实际伤害相同。", "尖刺外壳只有在受到玩家控制来源的伤害后会反弹。", "反弹的伤害与司夜刺客受到的伤害类型相同。", "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["reflect_duration", "stun_duration", "damage_reflect_pct", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_burrow", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·钻地", "name_en": "Burrow", "description_zh": "司夜刺客经过短时间的掘地后钻入地下。钻地后尖刺外壳一施放就会直接眩晕附近所有敌人，神智爆裂和穿刺的施法距离提升，穿刺的冷却时间减少。钻地后司夜刺客固定在原地，无法攻击，并且是隐身状态。同时司夜刺客受到的所有伤害都会降低。", "description_en": "Nyx Assassin buries himself beneath the battlefield over a short duration. Once burrowed, Spiked Carapace instantly stuns nearby enemies when cast, the range of Mind Flare and Impale is increased, and Impale's cooldown is decreased. While burrowed, Nyx Assassin is stationary, unable to attack, and invisible. Nyx Assassin gains damage reduction from all damage sources.", "notes_zh": ["施放复仇将取消钻地状态。"], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["health_regen_rate", "mana_regen_rate", "damage_reduction", "cast_range", "cooldown_reduction", "carapace_radius", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_neuro_sting", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·法力燃烧", "name_en": "Mana Burn", "description_zh": "司夜刺客对敌人造成伤害还会燃烧造成伤害一定百分比的魔法。", "description_en": "Nyx Assassin's damage on enemies also burns mana as a percentage of the damage dealt.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["mana_burn_pct"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_vendetta", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·复仇", "name_en": "Vendetta", "description_zh": "司夜刺客进入隐身状态并获得移动速度加成。如果司夜刺客以攻击打破隐身，当次攻击将造成超高额外伤害，并对目标施加破坏效果。司夜刺客当次攻击具有%attack_range_bonus%额外攻击距离，并且攻击动作加快%attack_animation_bonus%%%。", "description_en": "Nyx Assassin becomes invisible and gains a speed bonus. If Nyx Assassin attacks to break the invisibility, massive bonus damage is dealt with the attack that applies a break to the target. Nyx Assassin has %attack_range_bonus% additional attack range and a %attack_animation_bonus%%% faster attack animation for this attack.", "notes_zh": ["如果在隐身期间使用了技能，或者隐身时间结束，额外伤害的效果将会消失。", "会在造成额外伤害前施加破坏效果。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "冷却时间减少%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒。在复仇的最初%free_pathing_duration%秒内，司夜刺客为极速状态，并且移动无视地形。", "en": "Decreases cooldown by %bonus_AbilityCooldown%s. For the first %free_pathing_duration%s of Vendetta, Nyx is hasted and has unobstructed pathing."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "movement_speed", "bonus_damage", "health_regen_rate_scepter", "mana_regen_rate_scepter", "break_duration", "free_pathing_duration", "free_pathing_movement_speed_bonus", "attack_animation_bonus", "attack_range_bonus", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_mirror_image", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·镜像", "name_en": "Mirror Image", "description_zh": "制造多个受娜迦海妖控制的镜像。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Creates multiple images of Naga Siren under her control.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["娜迦海妖在施法时有%invuln_duration%秒的无敌时间，可以用来躲避眩晕和伤害。", "施放后，将会移除娜迦海妖身上大部分效果。", "施放时现有的镜像幻象将被摧毁。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["illusion_duration", "outgoing_damage", "outgoing_damage_tooltip", "incoming_damage", "tooltip_incoming_damage_total_pct", "images_count", "invuln_duration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_ensnare", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·诱捕", "name_en": "Ensnare", "description_zh": "打断目标的动作并将其困在原地，使其无法移动或闪烁。可以对海妖之歌作用下的单位施放。", "description_en": "Interrupts the target and traps them in place, preventing movement or blinking. Can target units affected by Song of the Siren.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升施法距离和弹道速度。诱捕可以对减益免疫单位施放并且生效。诱捕会施加破坏效果。", "en": "Increases cast range and projectile speed.  Allows Ensnare to target and affect Debuff Immune units. Ensnare applies Break."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "net_speed", "fake_ensnare_distance", "can_target_magic_immune", "does_break", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_rip_tide", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·激流", "name_en": "Rip Tide", "description_zh": "娜迦海妖和她的幻象每经过%hits%次攻击后就会对敌人造成额外伤害，并降低他们的护甲，持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Naga Siren and her illusions deal bonus damage to enemies and reduce their armor for %duration% seconds every %hits% attacks.", "notes_zh": ["使用激流不会打断持续施法。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["hits", "armor_reduction", "damage", "radius", "duration"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_eelskin", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·鳗鱼皮", "name_en": "Eelskin", "description_zh": "娜迦海妖拥有闪避加成，%radius%内每增加一个娜迦海妖都会提升。", "description_en": "Naga Siren has bonus evasion, increased per every other Naga Siren within %radius% radius.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["evasion_per_naga", "radius"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_song_of_the_siren", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·海妖之歌", "name_en": "Song of the Siren", "description_zh": "娜迦海妖周围的所有敌人受到魔法影响陷入停滞状态，既无法行动也不会受到攻击。再次使用海妖之歌可以提前停止效果。", "description_en": "All enemies in range of the Naga Siren are put into a magical stasis where they cannot act or be attacked. Using Song of the Siren again will end the duration early.", "notes_zh": ["海妖之歌作用下的单位处于无敌状态，不会受到任何伤害。", "海妖之歌的作用范围以娜迦海妖为中心，如果她远离了作用单位，他们将会醒来。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "海妖之歌范围内友军每秒会恢复一定百分比的生命和魔法。", "en": "Allies in range of Song of the Siren recover a percentage of their health and mana per second."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "animation_rate", "heal_pct", "mana_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "keeper_of_the_light_illuminate", "name_zh": "光之守卫·冲击波", "name_en": "Illuminate", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 引导光的能量，持续施法的时间越长，威力越大。释放后，光波沿直线向前发出，造成伤害并获得沿途的视野。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Channels light energy, building power the longer it's channeled.  Once released, a wave is sent forth that deals damage and gives vision in its path.  The longer it is channeled, the more damage is dealt.", "notes_zh": ["在持续施法期间获得的视野不断增大。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["total_damage", "max_channel_time", "radius", "range", "speed", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "channel_vision_radius", "channel_vision_interval", "channel_vision_duration", "channel_vision_step", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "keeper_of_the_light_blinding_light", "name_zh": "光之守卫·致盲之光", "name_en": "Blinding Light", "description_zh": "一道致盲之光在目标区域闪现，把区域内的单位击退到区域边缘，并造成致盲，使他们的部分攻击不能命中。最短击退距离是在%knockback_duration%秒内击退%knockback_distance%距离。", "description_en": "A blinding light flashes over the targeted area, knocking back units to the edge of the area and blinding them, causing them to miss some attacks. Minimum knockback distance is %knockback_distance% range over %knockback_duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["落地后受作用单位将摧毁150范围内的树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["miss_rate", "duration", "radius", "knockback_duration", "knockback_distance", "damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
